bel_distribution_deterministic_pct: 36\n      ambiguous_label_rate_margin_lt_5_pct: 42\n      clear_det_signal_task_count: 4\n      mixed_signal_task_count: 3\n      internal_dominant_task_count: 8\n      gpu_hours_used: 35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B 在多数 ScienceWorld 任务上已足够 competent，内部推理仅在物理状态转换任务\n      (boil/melt/change-state/freeze) 上系统性失败导致 agent death。其余 11 类任务逻辑较简单\n      (find/move/classify objects)，三种 modality 产生相似 trajectory。结果是 42% 的 step 标签\n      模糊 (best 与 second-best 差距 < 5 分)。Deep-internal 很少优于 fast-internal，因为\n      ScienceWorld 中内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 chain-of-thought——瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识，\n      不是推理深度。标签信号集中在 death-risk 任务的步骤上，占全部训练数据的 ~27%，其余 73% 基本\n      是噪声。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Label distribution by task group\"\n        columns: [task_group, n_tasks, fast_internal_pct, deep_internal_pct, deterministic_pct, ambiguous_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [death-risk, 4, 18, 12, 70, 22]\n          - [marginal, 3, 38, 24, 38, 45]\n          - [low-risk, 8, 55, 25, 20, 52]\n          - [overall, 15, 42, 22, 36, 42]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Per-step score margin (best minus second-best) histogram, 6600 steps. Heavy left tail:\n        42% margin < 5。Long right tail (margin > 30) 几乎完全来自 death-risk 任务步骤\n        (deterministic 阻止 -100 penalty)。Bimodal 分布清晰暴露 label noise 问题。\n    analysis: >\n      高 ambiguity rate 是下游所有失败的根因 (A4)。4 类 death-risk 任务贡献了不成比例的清晰\n      标签 (70% deterministic-best, 仅 22% ambiguous)。若仅用这 4 类任务训练 router，accuracy\n      可能 >75%。问题是 dilution: 73% 训练步骤来自 modality 选择几乎无影响的任务，router 学到的\n      主要是噪声。可能的补救 (worst tier 未实施): class-weighted loss、过滤低 margin 样本、\n      只用高信号步骤训练。\n\n  - name: \"Router SFT training (Qwen3-1.7B)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-002\"\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-1.7B on counterfactual labels. 3-way classification:\n      (history, observation) → {fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic}. 80/20 stratified split.\n    expected_results:\n      train_samples: 5280\n    