old.\n      CogRouter (84.6) / ITP-R (62.58) from papers.\n    expected_results:\n      simgate_score_overall: 65.2\n      always_internal_overall: 59.5\n      always_det_overall: 64.8\n      oracle_routing_overall: 70.0\n      random_routing_overall: 62.1\n      confidence_threshold_overall: 63.5\n      cogrouter_cited: 84.6\n      itpr_cited: 62.58\n      simgate_minus_internal: 5.7\n      simgate_minus_internal_ci90: [1.2, 10.3]\n      simgate_minus_always_det: 0.4\n      simgate_minus_always_det_ci90: [-4.8, 5.6]\n      oracle_minus_always_det: 5.2\n      oracle_minus_always_det_ci90: [1.0, 9.4]\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 19.7\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 13.0\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_det_pct: 6.3\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_oracle_pct: 4.0\n      catastrophic_failure_reduction_simgate_vs_internal_pct: 34\n      router_accuracy_on_eval_pct: 60\n      simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 38\n      task_types_with_significant_simgate_gt_internal: 4\n      task_types_with_significant_internal_gt_simgate: 2\n      gpu_hours_used: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      SimGate 65.2 是两个方向力的净效应: (1) 4 类 death-risk 任务上路由到 det 避免 -100 死亡\n      惩罚带来的大幅提升，(2) 8 类 low-risk 任务上 noisy router 偶尔误路由到 det 导致 2-3 分\n      损失。净效应勉强超过 always-det (gap 0.4, CI [-4.8, 5.6] 跨零, A2 confirmed)。\n      关键: 成本结构不对称——safe task 上误路由到 det 代价小 (~5 分)，death-risk task 上未路由\n      到 det 代价巨大 (-100)。这种不对称使 always-det 成为极强 baseline: 它在 easy task 上\n      的效率损失远小于它在 death-risk task 上的安全收益。SimGate 的 34% catastrophic failure\n      reduction vs internal 看似有意义，但 always-det 的 68% reduction 远超 SimGate——router\n      55% 的 det recall 意味着近一半该拦截的死亡事件漏过。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Main results (ScienceWorld, 15 task types × 20 episodes)\"\n        columns: [method, overall, death_risk_4, marginal_3, low_risk_8, sim_inv_pct, cf_rate_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [always-internal, 59.5, 13.5, 57.3, 83.3, 0, 19.7]\n          - [always-det, 64.8, 45.5, 58.0, 77.0, 100, 6.3]\n          - [\"random(50/50)\", 62.1, 29.5, 57.7, 80.1, 50, 13.0]\n          - [conf-threshold, 63.5, 35.0, 57.8, 78.5, 42, 10.5]\n          - [SimGate, 65.2, 38.5, 58.0, 81.3, 38, 13.0]\n          - [oracle, 70.0, 46.5, 62.0, 84.8, 33, 4.0]\n          - [\"CogRouter†\", 84.6, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"ITP-R†\", 62.58, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Per-task SimGate breakdown\"\n        columns: [task_type, group, internal, det, simgate, oracle, sig_vs_internal]\n        rows:\n          - [boil, death-risk, 12, 48, 40, 49, \"yes (+28)\"]\n          - [melt, death-risk, 8, 42, 35, 43, \"yes (+27)\"]\n          - [change-state, death-risk, 14, 50, 43, 51, \"yes (+29)\"]\n          - [freeze, death-risk, 20, 42, 36, 43, \"yes (+16)\"]\n          - [mix-paint, marginal, 56, 60, 58, 62, \"no (+2)\"]\n          - [chemistry-mix, marginal, 52, 56, 54, 58, \"no (+2)\"]\n          - [grow-plant, marginal, 64, 58, 62, 66, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [use-thermometer, low-risk, 86, 79, 84, 87, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [power-component, low-risk, 79, 73, 77, 81, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [find-living, low-risk, 92, 85, 90, 93, \"sig neg (-2)\"]\n          - [find-nonliving, low-risk, 90, 83, 88, 91, \"sig neg (-2)\"]\n          - [use-instrument, low-risk, 83, 76, 81, 85, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [move-object, low-risk, 70, 66, 68, 72, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [clean, low-risk, 86, 79, 84, 87, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [pick-and-place, low-risk, 80, 75, 78, 82, \"no (-2)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart, overall score by method。SimGate (65.2) 与 always-det (64.8) 几乎\n        等高，两者 90% CI error bars 完全重叠。CogRouter (84.6) 遥遥领先。视觉上 selective\n        routing 的价值不可见。\n      - >\n        Per-task score comparison (internal vs det vs SimGate), 15 task types sorted by\n        det-internal gap。清晰 bimodal: 4 个 death-risk tasks 有 30+ 点 gap (占图左侧),\n        其余 11 个 tasks gap 在 [-8, 4] 之间 (占图右侧)。SimGate 在左侧 track det，\n        右侧 track internal，但两端都不如对应 baseline。\n    analysis: >\n      SimGate (65.2) 与 CogRouter (84.6) 的 19.4 分差距部分是 backbone 差异，部分是训练方法\n      差异 (SFT routing vs CoPO RL)。更致命的是 SimGate 与 always-det 仅差 0.4 分——learned\n      routing 相比 trivial baseline 无增量价值。Oracle 在 70.0 表明即使完美 per-step routing\n      也只比 always-det 多 5.2 分——per-step routing 在 ScienceWorld 的理论 ceiling 就很低。\n      去掉 4 类 death-risk 任务，SimGate (81.3) 反而低于 internal (83.3)，selective routing\n      在 safe tasks 上有净损失。支持 Pivot A thesis: deterministic computation 仅在特定\n      catastrophic-failure-prone task types 有价值，learned routing 不是正确机制。\n\n  - name: \"Explicit vs implicit routing ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-004\"\n    description: >\n      Core C2 ablation。Explicit: SimGate router (Qwen3-1.7B)。Implicit: Qwen2.5-7B backbone\n      trained to output [SIMULATE] at oracle-labeled steps。Same counterfactual data。\n    expected_results:\n      explicit_simgate_overall: 65.2\n      implicit_backbone_overall: 64.0\n      explicit_minus_implicit: 1.2\n      explicit_minus_implicit_ci90: [-2.3, 4.7]\n      p_value: 0.38\n      significant: false\n      explicit_wins_task_count: 8\n      implicit_wins_task_count: 7\n      explicit_sim_inv_pct: 38\n      implicit_sim_inv_pct: 34\n      gpu_hours_used: 9\n    result_rationale: >\n      Explicit ≈ implicit (A3) 因为 routing signal 本身太弱，架构选择无法产生差异。当底层\n      pattern 是 noisy 的 (42% ambiguous labels)，1.7B 独立 router 和 7B backbone 学到的\n      都是相同的粗糙 heuristic (\"death-risk task → simulate\")。7B backbone 有更多 capacity\n      检测 routing-relevant features 但同时要管理 action generation 产生干扰；1.7B router\n      更 focused 但 capacity 受限。两个 trade-off 相消。Per-task 无一致 pattern: explicit\n      在部分 death-risk tasks 上稍好 (det-routing 更果断)，implicit 在部分 low-risk tasks\n      上稍好 (backbone 知道自己不需要 simulation)。C2 的核心证据失败。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Explicit vs implicit routing\"\n        columns: [method, overall, death_risk_4, marginal_3, low_risk_8, sim_inv_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"explicit (SimGate 1.7B router)\", 65.2, 38.5, 58.0, 81.3, 38]\n          - [\"implicit (backbone [SIMULATE])\", 64.0, 36.0, 57.5, 82.0, 34]\n          - [delta, \"+1.2\", \"+2.5\", \"+0.5\", \"-0.7\", \"+4\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Per-task scatter: x=explicit score, y=implicit score。Points 紧密聚集在 y=x 对角线\n        附近，无系统偏离。8 个 task 在 diagonal 上方 (explicit wins), 7 个在下方 (implicit wins)。\n    analysis: >\n      C2 失败是对 paper framing 冲击最大的结果。没有 explicit > implicit，paper 无法声称 modular\n      router 的架构贡献。但这个 negative result 在 Pivot A/C 下有价值: 它表明当 deterministic\n      computation 可用时，routing mechanism 的选择不如 WHETHER to route 重要——架构选择是次要的，\n      实证问题 (何时 simulation 有帮助) 才是核心。对 Pivot C，此结果论证 per-step routing (无论\n      explicit 或 implicit) 不是正确粒度，支持 trajectory-level 或 subtask-level routing 作为\n      future work。\n\n  - name: \"Per-task routing pattern analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-005\"\n    description: >\n      分析 plan-003 routing patterns: per-task routing heatmap, episode phase analysis,\n      failure mode clustering。原定为 paper Figure 1。\n    expected_results:\n      distinct_routing_clusters: 2\n      cluster_1_desc: \"death-risk tasks (4 tasks, >65% det-routing)\"\n      cluster_2_desc: \"all others (11 tasks, 20-45% det-routing, high variance)\"\n      phase_pattern_significant: false\n      early_phase_det_pct: 36\n      mid_phase_det_pct: 39\n      late_phase_det_pct: 38\n      failure_modes_identified: 1\n      primary_failure_mode: \"physical state transition hallucination\"\n      router_entropy_high_task_count: 11\n      router_entropy_low_task_count: 4\n      gpu_hours_used: 1.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      A5: routing structure 仅存在于 death-risk/safe 的 binary 划分之上。11/15 task types 的\n      router 决策高熵 (接近随机)，因为这些任务的训练信号本身 ambiguous。Phase analysis 无显著\n      时间模式，因为 ScienceWorld 中 death risk 是 state-dependent 而非 phase-dependent——\n      危险动作 (如把物体放在加热源上) 可发生在任意 step。唯一可识别的 failure mode (物理状态\n      转换幻觉) 已在 MVP 中已知；15 task 全量分析未发现新类别。尝试细分 (温度估计/化学反应/\n      电学状态) 在每类仅 20 episodes 下无法达到统计显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Routing statistics by task group\"\n        columns: [task_group, n_tasks, mean_det_routing_pct, std_det_routing_pct, mean_router_entropy]\n        rows:\n          - [death-risk, 4, 67, 8, 0.62]\n          - [marginal, 3, 38, 12, 0.91]\n          - [low-risk, 8, 25, 11, 0.88]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Routing heatmap: 15 task types (y) × 3 episode phases (x), color=deterministic routing\n        frequency。仅底部 4 行 (death-risk) 显示一致 warm colors (>60%)。上部 11 行噪声大，\n        混合色调，无 phase-dependent pattern。视觉上分为两个色带而非论文需要的 nuanced gradient。\n        不适合作为 methods paper 的 Figure 1。\n      - >\n        Router entropy distribution, 15 task types。Bimodal: 4 tasks entropy ~0.62 (有信心\n        routing), 11 tasks entropy ~0.88-0.91 (接近随机)。无中间 cluster。\n    analysis: >\n      Routing analysis 同时是 worst tier 最弱和最有价值的结果。弱因为它无法产出 methods paper\n      需要的 compelling heatmap——pattern 本质上是 binary。但在 Pivot A 下，这个 binary pattern\n      就是核心 finding: deterministic computation 有效当且仅当任务涉及 catastrophic failure\n      prone 的物理状态转换。缺乏 phase pattern 和 failure mode 细粒度进一步支持收益是\n      task-type-level 而非 step-level。Paper figure 应从 \"routing heatmap\" 转向 \"per-task\n      benefit analysis\"——展示 (det - internal) gap per task type sorted by magnitude，4 个\n      death-risk tasks 清晰分离。\n\n  - name: \"2-way vs 3-way routing ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-006\"\n    description: >\n      Compare {internal, deterministic} vs {fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic}。\n      测试 fast/deep internal 区分是否有价值。\n    expected_results:\n      two_way_overall: 64.8\n      three_way_overall: 65.2\n      delta: 0.4\n      delta_ci90: [-3.1, 3.9]\n      significant: false\n      two_way_router_accuracy_pct: 63\n      three_way_router_accuracy_pct: 58\n      gpu_hours_used: 7\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fast/deep 区分在 ScienceWorld 中 negligible，因为内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 CoT——\n      瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识而非推理深度。2-way router accuracy 更高 (63% vs 58%)\n      因为只需学一个决策边界 (simulate-or-not)。但 accuracy 优势不转化为 end-to-end 改善，\n      因为额外的 deep-internal steps 在 3-way 中影响接近零——它们只增加 tokens 而不改变 action。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"2-way vs 3-way routing\"\n        columns: [scheme, router_acc_pct, overall_score, sim_inv_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"{internal, det} 2-way\", 63, 64.8, 40]\n          - [\"{fast, deep, det} 3-way\", 58, 65.2, 38]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      简化 method description (2-way 即可) 但也弱化 \"compute-efficient routing\" narrative——\n      router 无法有效区分 cheap/expensive internal reasoning。Paper 中应 collapse 为 2-way，\n      3-way 作为 appendix ablation。在 Pivot A 下，进一步支持唯一有意义的 routing decision 是\n      simulate-or-not，且即便如此也仅比 always-simulate 好 0.4 分。\n\n  - name: \"Boil task rerun with v3 code\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-007\"\n    description: >\n      用 clean v3 代码重跑 boil task (无 >= tie-break, 有 proper death filter)，\n      与其余 14 类任务统一分析基准。\n    expected_results:\n      boil_internal_mean: -48.2\n      boil_det_mean: -18.3\n      boil_oracle_mean: -10.5\n      boil_det_minus_internal: 29.9\n      boil_det_minus_internal_ci90: [15.0, 44.8]\n      episodes: 20\n      death_rate_internal_pct: 70\n      death_rate_det_pct: 25\n      gpu_hours_used: 2.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      v3 boil 结果与 MVP 一致 (internal -49.8→-48.2, det -19.7→-18.3)。Oracle 显著改善\n      (-29.7→-10.5) 因为 v3 代码修正了 per-step label composition 逻辑——旧 >= tie-break\n      在 hindsight labeling 中人为劣化了 oracle labels。Death rate 确认机制: 70% 纯 internal\n      episodes 死亡 (幻觉温度物理), 25% deterministic 仍死亡——这 25% 是 simulation 正确执行\n      了 action 但 action 本身策略性错误 (simulation 防执行错误不防规划错误)。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      定性确认 MVP finding。Oracle 改善验证了 v3 code fix。此 task 仍是 deterministic\n      simulation 价值的最强证据，但仅是 4/15 类显著获益任务之一。\n\n  - name: \"Router size ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-008\"\n    description: >\n      Compare Qwen2.5-1.5B / Qwen3-1.7B / Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router。测试 router capacity\n      敏感性。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen25_1_5b_accuracy_pct: 56\n      qwen3_1_7b_accuracy_pct: 58\n      qwen25_3b_accuracy_pct: 60\n      qwen25_1_5b_overall_score: 64.0\n      qwen3_1_7b_overall_score: 65.2\n      qwen25_3b_overall_score: 65.8\n      accuracy_range_pct: 4\n      score_range: 1.8\n      gpu_hours_used: 11\n    result_rationale: >\n      三种 size 表现在噪声范围内，因为瓶颈是 label quality 而非 model capacity (A4)。4 点\n      accuracy 差 (56→60%) 不转化为有意义的 end-to-end 分差 (1.8 分范围)，因为更大 router\n      多正确分类的步骤主要在 low-risk tasks 上——那里 modality 选择影响 negligible。在 death-risk\n      tasks 上 (正确分类 impact 大) 三种 size accuracy 相近 (~62-65%)，因为 surface features\n      (temperature/heat/phase-change keywords) 对最小模型也足够显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Router size comparison\"\n        columns: [router, params, accuracy_3way_pct, overall_score, death_risk_4_score]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, 1.5B, 56, 64.0, 36.5]\n          - [Qwen3-1.7B, 1.7B, 58, 65.2, 38.5]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, 3B, 60, 65.8, 39.0]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      支持 \"lightweight router suffices\" 但原因错误: 所有 size 都被 label noise 瓶颈限制，\n      不是因为小 router 已 sufficient。Reviewer 可能指出这只是 trivially 验证了小 router 选择。\n      Paper 中应表述为: ScienceWorld routing 问题是 feature-limited (relevant signals 是\n      surface-level keywords) 而非 capacity-limited。\n\n  - name: \"MATH track — code interpreter routing\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-009\"\n    description: >\n      500 Level 4-5 MATH problems, 3-way routing (fast-internal / deep-internal / code-interpreter).\n      Demonstrates generalization beyond environment simulators.\n    expected_results:\n      status: not_attempted\n      reason: >\n        ScienceWorld 结果偏弱且 deadline 仅剩 ~4 天，20 GPU hours + 3 天实验成本不合理。\n        Selective routing ≈ always-det 的结论可能在 MATH 上重现 (code interpreter 已被\n        ReTool/ToRA 充分研究，routing contribution 太弱无法差异化)。\n    result_rationale: >\n      资源重新分配至最大化 ScienceWorld 分析深度。Pivot A (\"When Does Deterministic Computation\n      Help?\") 框架下，单 domain 深入 (15 task types) 比浅层双 domain 更有价值。MATH 可作\n      future work 提及。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      不跑 MATH 是 worst tier 下正确的资源分配。若 paper pivot 到 Pivot A，单 domain\n      的 diagnostic depth 是核心贡献; 加入 MATH 会稀释 analysis 焦点且可能产生另一组\n      ambiguous 结果。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-task transfer within ScienceWorld\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-010\"\n    description: >\n      Train router on chemistry tasks only → evaluate on physics tasks (vice versa).\n      测试 routing patterns 的跨 domain 迁移性。\n    expected_results:\n      chemistry_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 62\n      physics_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 55\n      chemistry_to_physics_accuracy_pct: 49\n      physics_to_chemistry_accuracy_pct: 47\n      chemistry_to_physics_overall_score: 61.5\n      physics_to_chemistry_overall_score: 60.0\n      random_baseline_accuracy_pct: 33\n      gpu_hours_used: 4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-task transfer 失败因为 router 学到的是 task-specific surface features 而非\n      transferable routing patterns。Chemistry 路由依赖 keywords (temperature, heat, boil,\n      substance) 不出现在 physics tasks (circuit, voltage, connect)；router 的 learned features\n      跨词汇域不泛化。Chemistry→physics 降至 49% (高于 random 33% 但远低于 within-domain 62%)，\n      说明 router 捕捉了少量 domain-general 信号 (如 \"agent 即将改变物理状态\") 但大部分\n      accuracy 来自 domain-specific lexical matching。Physics→chemistry 更差 (47%) 因为\n      physics tasks 整体 routing signal 更弱 (within-domain 仅 55%)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-task transfer matrix\"\n        columns: [train_domain, eval_domain, accuracy_pct, overall_score]\n        rows:\n          - [chemistry, chemistry, 62, 65.0]\n          - [chemistry, physics, 49, 61.5]\n          - [physics, physics, 55, 63.0]\n          - [physics, chemistry, 47, 60.0]\n          - [\"all (SimGate)\", all, 58, 65.2]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Poor transfer 与 A5 一致 (routing structure 不超越 task identity)。在 Pivot A 下，\n      此结果强化 thesis: routing to deterministic computation 是 task-dependent phenomenon，\n      不是 learnable general skill。Router 必须被 told (或从每种 specific failure mode 的\n      examples 中 learn) 它应拦截什么。Motivates future work on meta-learning or few-shot\n      routing。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10575,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10575},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"38cf3b9f-177b-4d21-8c68-b4701e84ba77","uuid":"0a72d602-8568-408e-9b2b-82865db42fba"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":623174,"duration_api_ms":624715,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  C1 partially survives but greatly diminished: selective routing ≈ unconditional simulation\n  (gap 0.4, CI crosses zero), gains concentrated in 4/15 death-risk task types. C2 fails:\n  explicit ≈ implicit (gap 1.2, CI crosses zero). Original framing (\"safety-aware modular\n  routing\") cannot hold as primary contribution. Recommended pivot: Pivot A (\"When Does\n  Deterministic Computation Help LLM Agents?\"). The strong task-dependency of simulation value\n  (4 death-risk tasks vs 11 low-risk tasks) becomes the central finding. The negative result\n  on selective vs unconditional becomes evidence that per-step routing is the wrong granularity.\n  Counterfactual evaluation methodology + per-task diagnostic analysis provide sufficient\n  contribution for EMNLP short paper, though Findings is more realistic than Main. Pivot C is\n  secondary option if reviewer framing favors negative-result papers. Pivot B is weakest given\n  noisy labels (A4). Key writing strategy: maximize diagnostic analysis depth — per-task\n  breakdowns, error case studies, failure mode characterization are the paper's value, not\n  the method.\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Counterfactual trajectory collection (15 task types)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-001\"\n    description: >\n      Collect 3-modality counterfactual trajectories on 15 ScienceWorld task types, 20 episodes\n      each. At each step fork into fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic; label best\n      modality via hindsight trajectory scoring.\n    expected_results:\n      total_task_types: 15\n      episodes_per_task: 20\n      total_episodes: 300\n      avg_steps_per_episode: 22\n      total_labeled_steps: 6600\n      label_distribution_fast_internal_pct: 42\n      label_distribution_deep_internal_pct: 22\n      label_distribution_deterministic_pct: 36\n      ambiguous_label_rate_margin_lt_5_pct: 42\n      clear_det_signal_task_count: 4\n      mixed_signal_task_count: 3\n      internal_dominant_task_count: 8\n      gpu_hours_used: 35\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B 在多数 ScienceWorld 任务上已足够 competent，内部推理仅在物理状态转换任务\n      (boil/melt/change-state/freeze) 上系统性失败导致 agent death。其余 11 类任务逻辑较简单\n      (find/move/classify objects)，三种 modality 产生相似 trajectory。结果是 42% 的 step 标签\n      模糊 (best 与 second-best 差距 < 5 分)。Deep-internal 很少优于 fast-internal，因为\n      ScienceWorld 中内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 chain-of-thought——瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识，\n      不是推理深度。标签信号集中在 death-risk 任务的步骤上，占全部训练数据的 ~27%，其余 73% 基本\n      是噪声。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Label distribution by task group\"\n        columns: [task_group, n_tasks, fast_internal_pct, deep_internal_pct, deterministic_pct, ambiguous_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [death-risk, 4, 18, 12, 70, 22]\n          - [marginal, 3, 38, 24, 38, 45]\n          - [low-risk, 8, 55, 25, 20, 52]\n          - [overall, 15, 42, 22, 36, 42]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Per-step score margin (best minus second-best) histogram, 6600 steps. Heavy left tail:\n        42% margin < 5。Long right tail (margin > 30) 几乎完全来自 death-risk 任务步骤\n        (deterministic 阻止 -100 penalty)。Bimodal 分布清晰暴露 label noise 问题。\n    analysis: >\n      高 ambiguity rate 是下游所有失败的根因 (A4)。4 类 death-risk 任务贡献了不成比例的清晰\n      标签 (70% deterministic-best, 仅 22% ambiguous)。若仅用这 4 类任务训练 router，accuracy\n      可能 >75%。问题是 dilution: 73% 训练步骤来自 modality 选择几乎无影响的任务，router 学到的\n      主要是噪声。可能的补救 (worst tier 未实施): class-weighted loss、过滤低 margin 样本、\n      只用高信号步骤训练。\n\n  - name: \"Router SFT training (Qwen3-1.7B)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-002\"\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune Qwen3-1.7B on counterfactual labels. 3-way classification:\n      (history, observation) → {fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic}. 80/20 stratified split.\n    expected_results:\n      train_samples: 5280\n      val_samples: 1320\n      lr: 2.0e-5\n      batch_size: 32\n      epochs: 3\n      final_train_loss: 0.72\n      final_val_loss: 0.82\n      val_accuracy_3way_pct: 58\n      majority_class_baseline_pct: 42\n      precision_fast_internal: 0.62\n      recall_fast_internal: 0.68\n      precision_deep_internal: 0.45\n      recall_deep_internal: 0.35\n      precision_deterministic: 0.58\n      recall_deterministic: 0.55\n      f1_macro: 0.53\n      gpu_hours_used: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      58% 3-way accuracy 反映 plan-001 的 noisy label ceiling (A4)。Router 学到的是粗糙近似:\n      输入含温度/加热/相变关键词 → 路由到 deterministic，否则 → fast-internal。Deep-internal 类\n      最难学 (recall 仅 35%)，因为它仅在 2-3 类任务的特定 state 下明确优于 fast-internal，样本量\n      太少。65% 的 deep-internal 误分类流向 fast-internal，确认 fast/deep 区分在 ScienceWorld\n      中无意义。Val loss 在 epoch 2 后 plateau (0.82→0.83)，继续训练无益因为瓶颈是标签噪声\n      而非模型容量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Per-class router performance\"\n        columns: [class, precision, recall, f1, support_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [fast-internal, 0.62, 0.68, 0.65, 42]\n          - [deep-internal, 0.45, 0.35, 0.39, 22]\n          - [deterministic, 0.58, 0.55, 0.56, 36]\n          - [macro-avg, 0.55, 0.53, 0.53, 100]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Train/val loss curves, 3 epochs。Train loss 稳定下降 (0.95→0.72)，val loss 到 epoch 2\n        趋平 (0.82) 后微升 (0.83)。Gap 小 (0.10) 但 val loss 绝对值高，表明问题是 label noise\n        而非 overfitting。\n    analysis: >\n      Deterministic recall 55% 意味着 router 遗漏了 45% 应该 simulate 的步骤——在 death-risk\n      任务上，这直接导致 ~45% 的致死事件未被拦截，解释了 plan-003 中 SimGate 仍有 13% catastrophic\n      failure rate (vs always-det 的 6.3%)。若合并 fast/deep 为 2-way，accuracy 可升至 ~63%\n      (plan-006 验证)。\n\n  - name: \"SimGate end-to-end evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-003\"\n    description: >\n      End-to-end evaluation: trained router + Qwen2.5-7B backbone on held-out episodes.\n      Compare against always-internal, always-det, oracle, random, confidence-threshold.\n      CogRouter (84.6) / ITP-R (62.58) from papers.\n    expected_results:\n      simgate_score_overall: 65.2\n      always_internal_overall: 59.5\n      always_det_overall: 64.8\n      oracle_routing_overall: 70.0\n      random_routing_overall: 62.1\n      confidence_threshold_overall: 63.5\n      cogrouter_cited: 84.6\n      itpr_cited: 62.58\n      simgate_minus_internal: 5.7\n      simgate_minus_internal_ci90: [1.2, 10.3]\n      simgate_minus_always_det: 0.4\n      simgate_minus_always_det_ci90: [-4.8, 5.6]\n      oracle_minus_always_det: 5.2\n      oracle_minus_always_det_ci90: [1.0, 9.4]\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_internal_pct: 19.7\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_simgate_pct: 13.0\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_det_pct: 6.3\n      catastrophic_failure_rate_oracle_pct: 4.0\n      catastrophic_failure_reduction_simgate_vs_internal_pct: 34\n      router_accuracy_on_eval_pct: 60\n      simulator_invocation_ratio_pct: 38\n      task_types_with_significant_simgate_gt_internal: 4\n      task_types_with_significant_internal_gt_simgate: 2\n      gpu_hours_used: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      SimGate 65.2 是两个方向力的净效应: (1) 4 类 death-risk 任务上路由到 det 避免 -100 死亡\n      惩罚带来的大幅提升，(2) 8 类 low-risk 任务上 noisy router 偶尔误路由到 det 导致 2-3 分\n      损失。净效应勉强超过 always-det (gap 0.4, CI [-4.8, 5.6] 跨零, A2 confirmed)。\n      关键: 成本结构不对称——safe task 上误路由到 det 代价小 (~5 分)，death-risk task 上未路由\n      到 det 代价巨大 (-100)。这种不对称使 always-det 成为极强 baseline: 它在 easy task 上\n      的效率损失远小于它在 death-risk task 上的安全收益。SimGate 的 34% catastrophic failure\n      reduction vs internal 看似有意义，但 always-det 的 68% reduction 远超 SimGate——router\n      55% 的 det recall 意味着近一半该拦截的死亡事件漏过。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Main results (ScienceWorld, 15 task types × 20 episodes)\"\n        columns: [method, overall, death_risk_4, marginal_3, low_risk_8, sim_inv_pct, cf_rate_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [always-internal, 59.5, 13.5, 57.3, 83.3, 0, 19.7]\n          - [always-det, 64.8, 45.5, 58.0, 77.0, 100, 6.3]\n          - [\"random(50/50)\", 62.1, 29.5, 57.7, 80.1, 50, 13.0]\n          - [conf-threshold, 63.5, 35.0, 57.8, 78.5, 42, 10.5]\n          - [SimGate, 65.2, 38.5, 58.0, 81.3, 38, 13.0]\n          - [oracle, 70.0, 46.5, 62.0, 84.8, 33, 4.0]\n          - [\"CogRouter†\", 84.6, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"ITP-R†\", 62.58, \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Per-task SimGate breakdown\"\n        columns: [task_type, group, internal, det, simgate, oracle, sig_vs_internal]\n        rows:\n          - [boil, death-risk, 12, 48, 40, 49, \"yes (+28)\"]\n          - [melt, death-risk, 8, 42, 35, 43, \"yes (+27)\"]\n          - [change-state, death-risk, 14, 50, 43, 51, \"yes (+29)\"]\n          - [freeze, death-risk, 20, 42, 36, 43, \"yes (+16)\"]\n          - [mix-paint, marginal, 56, 60, 58, 62, \"no (+2)\"]\n          - [chemistry-mix, marginal, 52, 56, 54, 58, \"no (+2)\"]\n          - [grow-plant, marginal, 64, 58, 62, 66, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [use-thermometer, low-risk, 86, 79, 84, 87, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [power-component, low-risk, 79, 73, 77, 81, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [find-living, low-risk, 92, 85, 90, 93, \"sig neg (-2)\"]\n          - [find-nonliving, low-risk, 90, 83, 88, 91, \"sig neg (-2)\"]\n          - [use-instrument, low-risk, 83, 76, 81, 85, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [move-object, low-risk, 70, 66, 68, 72, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [clean, low-risk, 86, 79, 84, 87, \"no (-2)\"]\n          - [pick-and-place, low-risk, 80, 75, 78, 82, \"no (-2)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Grouped bar chart, overall score by method。SimGate (65.2) 与 always-det (64.8) 几乎\n        等高，两者 90% CI error bars 完全重叠。CogRouter (84.6) 遥遥领先。视觉上 selective\n        routing 的价值不可见。\n      - >\n        Per-task score comparison (internal vs det vs SimGate), 15 task types sorted by\n        det-internal gap。清晰 bimodal: 4 个 death-risk tasks 有 30+ 点 gap (占图左侧),\n        其余 11 个 tasks gap 在 [-8, 4] 之间 (占图右侧)。SimGate 在左侧 track det，\n        右侧 track internal，但两端都不如对应 baseline。\n    analysis: >\n      SimGate (65.2) 与 CogRouter (84.6) 的 19.4 分差距部分是 backbone 差异，部分是训练方法\n      差异 (SFT routing vs CoPO RL)。更致命的是 SimGate 与 always-det 仅差 0.4 分——learned\n      routing 相比 trivial baseline 无增量价值。Oracle 在 70.0 表明即使完美 per-step routing\n      也只比 always-det 多 5.2 分——per-step routing 在 ScienceWorld 的理论 ceiling 就很低。\n      去掉 4 类 death-risk 任务，SimGate (81.3) 反而低于 internal (83.3)，selective routing\n      在 safe tasks 上有净损失。支持 Pivot A thesis: deterministic computation 仅在特定\n      catastrophic-failure-prone task types 有价值，learned routing 不是正确机制。\n\n  - name: \"Explicit vs implicit routing ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-004\"\n    description: >\n      Core C2 ablation。Explicit: SimGate router (Qwen3-1.7B)。Implicit: Qwen2.5-7B backbone\n      trained to output [SIMULATE] at oracle-labeled steps。Same counterfactual data。\n    expected_results:\n      explicit_simgate_overall: 65.2\n      implicit_backbone_overall: 64.0\n      explicit_minus_implicit: 1.2\n      explicit_minus_implicit_ci90: [-2.3, 4.7]\n      p_value: 0.38\n      significant: false\n      explicit_wins_task_count: 8\n      implicit_wins_task_count: 7\n      explicit_sim_inv_pct: 38\n      implicit_sim_inv_pct: 34\n      gpu_hours_used: 9\n    result_rationale: >\n      Explicit ≈ implicit (A3) 因为 routing signal 本身太弱，架构选择无法产生差异。当底层\n      pattern 是 noisy 的 (42% ambiguous labels)，1.7B 独立 router 和 7B backbone 学到的\n      都是相同的粗糙 heuristic (\"death-risk task → simulate\")。7B backbone 有更多 capacity\n      检测 routing-relevant features 但同时要管理 action generation 产生干扰；1.7B router\n      更 focused 但 capacity 受限。两个 trade-off 相消。Per-task 无一致 pattern: explicit\n      在部分 death-risk tasks 上稍好 (det-routing 更果断)，implicit 在部分 low-risk tasks\n      上稍好 (backbone 知道自己不需要 simulation)。C2 的核心证据失败。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Explicit vs implicit routing\"\n        columns: [method, overall, death_risk_4, marginal_3, low_risk_8, sim_inv_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"explicit (SimGate 1.7B router)\", 65.2, 38.5, 58.0, 81.3, 38]\n          - [\"implicit (backbone [SIMULATE])\", 64.0, 36.0, 57.5, 82.0, 34]\n          - [delta, \"+1.2\", \"+2.5\", \"+0.5\", \"-0.7\", \"+4\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Per-task scatter: x=explicit score, y=implicit score。Points 紧密聚集在 y=x 对角线\n        附近，无系统偏离。8 个 task 在 diagonal 上方 (explicit wins), 7 个在下方 (implicit wins)。\n    analysis: >\n      C2 失败是对 paper framing 冲击最大的结果。没有 explicit > implicit，paper 无法声称 modular\n      router 的架构贡献。但这个 negative result 在 Pivot A/C 下有价值: 它表明当 deterministic\n      computation 可用时，routing mechanism 的选择不如 WHETHER to route 重要——架构选择是次要的，\n      实证问题 (何时 simulation 有帮助) 才是核心。对 Pivot C，此结果论证 per-step routing (无论\n      explicit 或 implicit) 不是正确粒度，支持 trajectory-level 或 subtask-level routing 作为\n      future work。\n\n  - name: \"Per-task routing pattern analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-005\"\n    description: >\n      分析 plan-003 routing patterns: per-task routing heatmap, episode phase analysis,\n      failure mode clustering。原定为 paper Figure 1。\n    expected_results:\n      distinct_routing_clusters: 2\n      cluster_1_desc: \"death-risk tasks (4 tasks, >65% det-routing)\"\n      cluster_2_desc: \"all others (11 tasks, 20-45% det-routing, high variance)\"\n      phase_pattern_significant: false\n      early_phase_det_pct: 36\n      mid_phase_det_pct: 39\n      late_phase_det_pct: 38\n      failure_modes_identified: 1\n      primary_failure_mode: \"physical state transition hallucination\"\n      router_entropy_high_task_count: 11\n      router_entropy_low_task_count: 4\n      gpu_hours_used: 1.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      A5: routing structure 仅存在于 death-risk/safe 的 binary 划分之上。11/15 task types 的\n      router 决策高熵 (接近随机)，因为这些任务的训练信号本身 ambiguous。Phase analysis 无显著\n      时间模式，因为 ScienceWorld 中 death risk 是 state-dependent 而非 phase-dependent——\n      危险动作 (如把物体放在加热源上) 可发生在任意 step。唯一可识别的 failure mode (物理状态\n      转换幻觉) 已在 MVP 中已知；15 task 全量分析未发现新类别。尝试细分 (温度估计/化学反应/\n      电学状态) 在每类仅 20 episodes 下无法达到统计显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Routing statistics by task group\"\n        columns: [task_group, n_tasks, mean_det_routing_pct, std_det_routing_pct, mean_router_entropy]\n        rows:\n          - [death-risk, 4, 67, 8, 0.62]\n          - [marginal, 3, 38, 12, 0.91]\n          - [low-risk, 8, 25, 11, 0.88]\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Routing heatmap: 15 task types (y) × 3 episode phases (x), color=deterministic routing\n        frequency。仅底部 4 行 (death-risk) 显示一致 warm colors (>60%)。上部 11 行噪声大，\n        混合色调，无 phase-dependent pattern。视觉上分为两个色带而非论文需要的 nuanced gradient。\n        不适合作为 methods paper 的 Figure 1。\n      - >\n        Router entropy distribution, 15 task types。Bimodal: 4 tasks entropy ~0.62 (有信心\n        routing), 11 tasks entropy ~0.88-0.91 (接近随机)。无中间 cluster。\n    analysis: >\n      Routing analysis 同时是 worst tier 最弱和最有价值的结果。弱因为它无法产出 methods paper\n      需要的 compelling heatmap——pattern 本质上是 binary。但在 Pivot A 下，这个 binary pattern\n      就是核心 finding: deterministic computation 有效当且仅当任务涉及 catastrophic failure\n      prone 的物理状态转换。缺乏 phase pattern 和 failure mode 细粒度进一步支持收益是\n      task-type-level 而非 step-level。Paper figure 应从 \"routing heatmap\" 转向 \"per-task\n      benefit analysis\"——展示 (det - internal) gap per task type sorted by magnitude，4 个\n      death-risk tasks 清晰分离。\n\n  - name: \"2-way vs 3-way routing ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-006\"\n    description: >\n      Compare {internal, deterministic} vs {fast-internal, deep-internal, deterministic}。\n      测试 fast/deep internal 区分是否有价值。\n    expected_results:\n      two_way_overall: 64.8\n      three_way_overall: 65.2\n      delta: 0.4\n      delta_ci90: [-3.1, 3.9]\n      significant: false\n      two_way_router_accuracy_pct: 63\n      three_way_router_accuracy_pct: 58\n      gpu_hours_used: 7\n    result_rationale: >\n      Fast/deep 区分在 ScienceWorld 中 negligible，因为内部推理成功的任务不需要更长 CoT——\n      瓶颈是物理规则的事实性知识而非推理深度。2-way router accuracy 更高 (63% vs 58%)\n      因为只需学一个决策边界 (simulate-or-not)。但 accuracy 优势不转化为 end-to-end 改善，\n      因为额外的 deep-internal steps 在 3-way 中影响接近零——它们只增加 tokens 而不改变 action。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"2-way vs 3-way routing\"\n        columns: [scheme, router_acc_pct, overall_score, sim_inv_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [\"{internal, det} 2-way\", 63, 64.8, 40]\n          - [\"{fast, deep, det} 3-way\", 58, 65.2, 38]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      简化 method description (2-way 即可) 但也弱化 \"compute-efficient routing\" narrative——\n      router 无法有效区分 cheap/expensive internal reasoning。Paper 中应 collapse 为 2-way，\n      3-way 作为 appendix ablation。在 Pivot A 下，进一步支持唯一有意义的 routing decision 是\n      simulate-or-not，且即便如此也仅比 always-simulate 好 0.4 分。\n\n  - name: \"Boil task rerun with v3 code\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-007\"\n    description: >\n      用 clean v3 代码重跑 boil task (无 >= tie-break, 有 proper death filter)，\n      与其余 14 类任务统一分析基准。\n    expected_results:\n      boil_internal_mean: -48.2\n      boil_det_mean: -18.3\n      boil_oracle_mean: -10.5\n      boil_det_minus_internal: 29.9\n      boil_det_minus_internal_ci90: [15.0, 44.8]\n      episodes: 20\n      death_rate_internal_pct: 70\n      death_rate_det_pct: 25\n      gpu_hours_used: 2.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      v3 boil 结果与 MVP 一致 (internal -49.8→-48.2, det -19.7→-18.3)。Oracle 显著改善\n      (-29.7→-10.5) 因为 v3 代码修正了 per-step label composition 逻辑——旧 >= tie-break\n      在 hindsight labeling 中人为劣化了 oracle labels。Death rate 确认机制: 70% 纯 internal\n      episodes 死亡 (幻觉温度物理), 25% deterministic 仍死亡——这 25% 是 simulation 正确执行\n      了 action 但 action 本身策略性错误 (simulation 防执行错误不防规划错误)。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      定性确认 MVP finding。Oracle 改善验证了 v3 code fix。此 task 仍是 deterministic\n      simulation 价值的最强证据，但仅是 4/15 类显著获益任务之一。\n\n  - name: \"Router size ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-008\"\n    description: >\n      Compare Qwen2.5-1.5B / Qwen3-1.7B / Qwen2.5-3B 作为 router。测试 router capacity\n      敏感性。\n    expected_results:\n      qwen25_1_5b_accuracy_pct: 56\n      qwen3_1_7b_accuracy_pct: 58\n      qwen25_3b_accuracy_pct: 60\n      qwen25_1_5b_overall_score: 64.0\n      qwen3_1_7b_overall_score: 65.2\n      qwen25_3b_overall_score: 65.8\n      accuracy_range_pct: 4\n      score_range: 1.8\n      gpu_hours_used: 11\n    result_rationale: >\n      三种 size 表现在噪声范围内，因为瓶颈是 label quality 而非 model capacity (A4)。4 点\n      accuracy 差 (56→60%) 不转化为有意义的 end-to-end 分差 (1.8 分范围)，因为更大 router\n      多正确分类的步骤主要在 low-risk tasks 上——那里 modality 选择影响 negligible。在 death-risk\n      tasks 上 (正确分类 impact 大) 三种 size accuracy 相近 (~62-65%)，因为 surface features\n      (temperature/heat/phase-change keywords) 对最小模型也足够显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Router size comparison\"\n        columns: [router, params, accuracy_3way_pct, overall_score, death_risk_4_score]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, 1.5B, 56, 64.0, 36.5]\n          - [Qwen3-1.7B, 1.7B, 58, 65.2, 38.5]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, 3B, 60, 65.8, 39.0]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      支持 \"lightweight router suffices\" 但原因错误: 所有 size 都被 label noise 瓶颈限制，\n      不是因为小 router 已 sufficient。Reviewer 可能指出这只是 trivially 验证了小 router 选择。\n      Paper 中应表述为: ScienceWorld routing 问题是 feature-limited (relevant signals 是\n      surface-level keywords) 而非 capacity-limited。\n\n  - name: \"MATH track — code interpreter routing\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-009\"\n    description: >\n      500 Level 4-5 MATH problems, 3-way routing (fast-internal / deep-internal / code-interpreter).\n      Demonstrates generalization beyond environment simulators.\n    expected_results:\n      status: not_attempted\n      reason: >\n        ScienceWorld 结果偏弱且 deadline 仅剩 ~4 天，20 GPU hours + 3 天实验成本不合理。\n        Selective routing ≈ always-det 的结论可能在 MATH 上重现 (code interpreter 已被\n        ReTool/ToRA 充分研究，routing contribution 太弱无法差异化)。\n    result_rationale: >\n      资源重新分配至最大化 ScienceWorld 分析深度。Pivot A (\"When Does Deterministic Computation\n      Help?\") 框架下，单 domain 深入 (15 task types) 比浅层双 domain 更有价值。MATH 可作\n      future work 提及。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      不跑 MATH 是 worst tier 下正确的资源分配。若 paper pivot 到 Pivot A，单 domain\n      的 diagnostic depth 是核心贡献; 加入 MATH 会稀释 analysis 焦点且可能产生另一组\n      ambiguous 结果。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-task transfer within ScienceWorld\"\n    plan_id: \"plan-010\"\n    description: >\n      Train router on chemistry tasks only → evaluate on physics tasks (vice versa).\n      测试 routing patterns 的跨 domain 迁移性。\n    expected_results:\n      chemistry_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 62\n      physics_within_domain_accuracy_pct: 55\n      chemistry_to_physics_accuracy_pct: 49\n      physics_to_chemistry_accuracy_pct: 47\n      chemistry_to_physics_overall_score: 61.5\n      physics_to_chemistry_overall_score: 60.0\n      random_baseline_accuracy_pct: 33\n      gpu_hours_used: 4\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-task transfer 失败因为 router 学到的是 task-specific surface features 而非\n      transferable routing patterns。Chemistry 路由依赖 keywords (temperature, heat, boil,\n      substance) 不出现在 physics tasks (circuit, voltage, connect)；router 的 learned features\n      跨词汇域不泛化。Chemistry→physics 降至 49% (高于 random 33% 但远低于 within-domain 62%)，\n      说明 router 捕捉了少量 domain-general 信号 (如 \"agent 即将改变物理状态\") 但大部分\n      accuracy 来自 domain-specific lexical matching。Physics→chemistry 更差 (47%) 因为\n      physics tasks 整体 routing signal 更弱 (within-domain 仅 55%)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Cross-task transfer matrix\"\n        columns: [train_domain, eval_domain, accuracy_pct, overall_score]\n        rows:\n          - [chemistry, chemistry, 62, 65.0]\n          - [chemistry, physics, 49, 61.5]\n          - [physics, physics, 55, 63.0]\n          - [physics, chemistry, 47, 60.0]\n          - [\"all (SimGate)\", all, 58, 65.2]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Poor transfer 与 A5 一致 (routing structure 不超越 task identity)。在 Pivot A 下，\n      此结果强化 thesis: routing to deterministic computation 是 task-dependent phenomenon，\n      不是 learnable general skill。Router 必须被 told (或从每种 specific failure mode 的\n      examples 中 learn) 它应拦截什么。Motivates future work on meta-learning or few-shot\n      routing。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"38cf3b9f-177b-4d21-8c68-b4701e84ba77","total_cost_usd":0.8769372499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10575,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":31972,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10575,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":31972,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10575},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5533,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005613,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":31972,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10575,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8713242499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"642109dc-92c5-43f1-8d24-069f55b7e9c5"}
